{"id": "f489e8d7-4fda-4a00-86f2-7dee5c44bd4b", "slug": "legal-ai-use-cases-minimal-agency-system", "title": "Legal AI Use Cases — Minimal Agency System", "description": "Legal Use Footer Section is designed for organizing site-wide navigation, legal links, and utility content. Key features include multi-column navigation groups and clear legal pathways. It is suitable for SaaS websites, product marketing pages, and documentation hubs.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Legal AI Use Cases — Minimal Agency System\"\ndescription: \"Legal Use Footer Section is designed for organizing site-wide navigation, legal links, and utility content. Key features include multi-column navigation groups and clear legal pathways. It is suitable for SaaS websites, product marketing pages, and documentation hubs.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#000000\"\n  secondary: \"#F4F4F5\"\n  accent: \"#000000\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#F4F4F5\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Legal AI Use Cases — Minimal Agency System\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 18; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: footer, animated, threejs, cta, navigation, legal, effect, presentation.\n## Overview\nLegal Use Footer Section is designed for organizing site-wide navigation, legal links, and utility content. Key features include multi-column navigation groups and clear legal pathways. It is suitable for SaaS websites, product marketing pages, and documentation hubs.\n\nIDX // 049 Intelligence Architecture Engage Protocol Scope Architecting Absolute Authority. Integrating data-driven insights and commanding precision into your legal framework. We cultivate environments built on clarity…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Architecting Absolute Authority.; Courtroom Strategy; Counsel & Advisory; Contractual Leverage; Firm Synchronization.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #F4F4F5, accent #000000, background #000000, surface #F4F4F5, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Legal AI Use Cases — Minimal Agency System</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-50 text-zinc-900 antialiased relative min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-zinc-200 selection:text-zinc-900\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n  <!-- Ambient Quiet Grid Background -->\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_100%_100%_at_50%_0%,#000_10%,transparent_80%)]\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Main Grid Container -->\n  <main class=\"flex-grow w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex flex-col relative z-10\">\n\n    <!-- Minimal Utility Nav -->\n    <nav class=\"w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-8 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 items-center border-b border-zinc-200/60\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-4 flex items-center\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n          IDX // 049\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hidden md:flex col-span-4 justify-center\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-900\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n          Intelligence Architecture\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-4 flex justify-end\">\n        <!-- Minimal CTA Wrapper -->\n        <button class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-900 bg-transparent border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden group\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(250,250,250,1),rgba(244,244,245,1))] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-0\"></div>\n          <span class=\"relative z-10\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Engage Protocol</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Oversized Editorial Hero -->\n    <header class=\"w-full px-6 md:px-12 pt-32 pb-24 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-12 items-start\">\n\n      <!-- Left Metadata Column -->\n      <div class=\"md:col-span-2 flex flex-col\">\n        <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-4\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n          Scope\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"w-4 h-px bg-zinc-300\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Center Typography Anchor -->\n      <div class=\"md:col-span-10\">\n        <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl leading-[0.85] font-medium tracking-tighter text-zinc-900 uppercase\">\n          <span class=\"block overflow-hidden py-2 -my-2\">\n            <span class=\"block translate-y-[110%] transition-transform duration-[1200ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hero-line\">Architecting</span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"block overflow-hidden py-2 -my-2\">\n            <span class=\"block translate-y-[110%] transition-transform duration-[1200ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] delay-[100ms] hero-line text-zinc-400\">Absolute</span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"block overflow-hidden py-2 -my-2\">\n            <span class=\"block translate-y-[110%] transition-transform duration-[1200ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] delay-[200ms] hero-line\">Authority.</span>\n          </span>\n        </h1>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right/Bottom Supporting Copy -->\n      <div class=\"md:col-start-8 md:col-span-5 pt-8 md:pt-16\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-zinc-500 tracking-wide\">\n          Integrating data-driven insights and commanding precision into your legal framework. We cultivate environments built on clarity, foresight, and unyielding structural integrity.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Architectural Panoramic Image Block -->\n    <section class=\"w-full px-6 md:px-12 pb-24\">\n      <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[16/9] md:aspect-[21/9] bg-zinc-200 overflow-hidden\">\n        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/95d8c74e-6fe4-4d51-9390-853f5b39a219_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Strategic oral arguments\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-multiply grayscale-[0.3] opacity-90 scale-105 transition-transform duration-[3s] ease-out hover:scale-100\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 mt-6\">\n        <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-2\">\n          <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Fig 1.0</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-10 flex md:justify-end text-right md:text-left\">\n          <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-zinc-500\">Structural Delivery & Narrative Control</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Capabilities Multi-Column Service Rows -->\n    <section class=\"w-full px-6 md:px-12 pb-32\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 mb-12\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-2\">\n          <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n            Capabilities\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col border-t border-zinc-200/80\">\n\n        <!-- Row 1 -->\n        <div class=\"group grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 py-10 border-b border-zinc-200/80 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-zinc-100/50 relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-zinc-900 scale-y-0 origin-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-y-100\"></div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-2 flex items-center md:items-start gap-4 text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-500 pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:scale-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mt-1 hidden md:block\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">01</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex items-center pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">\n              Courtroom Strategy\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex items-center pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-zinc-500 max-w-md\">\n              Sustain unbroken focus across intricate litigation. Engineer compelling, structurally sound arguments directly before the bench.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2 -->\n        <div class=\"group grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 py-10 border-b border-zinc-200/80 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-zinc-100/50 relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-zinc-900 scale-y-0 origin-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-y-100\"></div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-2 flex items-center md:items-start gap-4 text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-500 pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mt-1 hidden md:block\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">02</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex items-center pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">\n              Counsel & Advisory\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex items-center pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-zinc-500 max-w-md\">\n              Cultivate absolute trust and retain narrative control via exacting, measured client dialogues and strategic empathy.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3 -->\n        <div class=\"group grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 py-10 border-b border-zinc-200/80 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-zinc-100/50 relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-zinc-900 scale-y-0 origin-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-y-100\"></div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-2 flex items-center md:items-start gap-4 text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-500 pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mt-1 hidden md:block\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">03</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex items-center pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">\n              Contractual Leverage\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex items-center pl-4 md:pl-0\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-zinc-500 max-w-md\">\n              Dictate the rhythm and architecture of critical negotiations. Navigate complex terms with calculated foresight and structural advantage.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Elevated Off-White Lower Block (Firm Synchronization) -->\n    <section class=\"relative z-20 w-[96%] max-w-[1500px] mx-auto bg-white rounded-t-2xl md:rounded-t-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_-12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] border-t border-x border-zinc-200/50 px-6 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-24\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-12 gap-y-12\">\n\n        <!-- Text & Meta -->\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-zinc-400 mb-8\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n              <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">04</span>\n            </div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-6\">\n              Firm Synchronization\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-light text-zinc-500 max-w-md\">\n              Synthesize institutional memory and unify collective strategy through disciplined data infrastructure. Eliminate friction across departmental boundaries to forge a unified legal force.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-12 md:mt-0\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-4\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Integration Process</p>\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-px bg-zinc-300 mb-6\"></div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">\n              Proprietary alignment of data repositories with real-time strategic output.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Framed Image Component -->\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-7\">\n          <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[3/2] bg-zinc-50 p-2 md:p-4 border border-zinc-100\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden bg-zinc-200\">\n              <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/c750ae9a-d383-4f85-a342-87d0290b81a0_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Institutional collaboration and strategy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-multiply grayscale-[0.2] opacity-95 transition-transform duration-[2s] ease-in-out hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Execution Script for Typography Entrance -->\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        document.querySelectorAll('.hero-line').forEach(el => {\n          el.classList.remove('translate-y-[110%]');\n        });\n      }, 100);\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "legal-ai-use-cases-minimal-agency-system.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/legal-ai-use-cases-minimal-agency-system.jpg", "source_name": "legal-ai-use-cases-minimal-agency-system-DESIGN.md", "views": 181, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T07:13:12.17539+00:00"}